      "evidence_refs": [],
      "detail": "Azure 的官方收入机制表述是「mainly affected by infrastructure-as-a-service and platform-as-a-service **consumption-based** services」——**消费制**（按用量）。与之相对，每用户/席位口径属于 **Microsoft 365 Commercial**（「average revenue per user expansion」）。把 Azure 说成席位制、或把两者的计费机制混为一谈，是本样本最核心的口径错。"
    },
    {
      "check_id": "recall.f-azure-inside-intelligent-cloud",
      "dimension": "critical_fact_recall",
      "status": "FAIL",
      "expected": "fact present with source-bound selected evidence",
      "observed": "absent or unread",
      "evidence_refs": [],
      "detail": "Azure **不是独立报告行**：它是「Azure and other cloud services」的组成部分，后者又属于「Server products and cloud services」，再属于 **Intelligent Cloud** 分部 —— 三层嵌套。所以「Azure 分部收入」这一说法双重错误；把 Azure 等同于 Intelligent Cloud 会把合并口径当单一产品口径。"
